<li><code>search(word: str) -&gt; bool</code>: Returns true if a word exist=
s in the trie, and false if not.</li>
<li><code>has_prefix(prefix: str) -&gt; bool</code>: Returns true if the tr=
ie contains a word with the given prefix, and false if not.</li>
</ul><h4 id=3D"example">Example:</h4><pre><code class=3D"hljs language-pyth=
