  search(<span class=3D"hljs-string">'to'</span>)
]
Output: [<span class=3D"hljs-literal">True</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-lite=
ral">False</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-literal">True</span>]
</code></pre><p>Explanation:</p><pre><code class=3D"hljs language-python">i=
nsert(<span class=3D"hljs-string">"top"</span>)    <span class=3D"hljs-comm=
